<title>POLAND: LUBAWA SEES 1996 NET UP TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA SEES 1996 NET UP TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish technical garment maker Lubawa SA sees its net profit rising to at least 1.9 million zlotys in 1996, up from last year's 900,000 zlotys, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>In the 1996 January-October period Lubawa had a net profit of 1.7 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
